# Observability

Purpose:
  Observability knowledge base router. Split into focused sub-specs
  for system, AI, events, and operations observability.

Owns: ./

Navigation:
  System: @system.sdd
  AI: @ai.sdd
  Events: @events.sdd
  Operations: @operations.sdd

ReadOrder:
  1 @system.sdd
  2 @ai.sdd
  3 @events.sdd
  4 @operations.sdd

Rules:
  [OBS-01] Observability MUST be designed into the system, not added later.
  [OBS-02] AI decision provenance MUST be reproducible.
  [OBS-03] Sensitive data MUST be redacted in all observability outputs.
  [OBS-04] Observability data MUST be classified (PUBLIC, INTERNAL, CONFIDENTIAL, SECRET).

State: +
